# This is the Next.js site's Laravel backend

Public origin: `https://admin.sadbhavnadham.org`
Frontend: `/home/sadbhavnadham/htdocs/sadbhavnadham.org` (`https://sadbhavnadham.org`)

New or changed APIs go **here**:

- Register JSON routes in `routes/api.php` (prefix `/api` is automatic)
- Controllers in `app/Http/Controllers/`
- Checkout/token routes use `EnsureWordPressApiToken` (`X-WP-TOKEN` = `WP_API_TOKEN`)
- Keep CORS `paths` including `api/*`; allow the Next.js origins in `config/cors.php`

Do not implement donate/payment APIs in the Next.js `src/app/api/` folder. Next only proxies to this app.

Next.js expected donate JSON (add here when building them): `/api/donate/causes`, `/causes/{slug}`, `/config`, `/pincode/{pincode}`, `/bank-details`, `/thank-you/{order}`, `/checkout`, `/checkout/subscription`, `/pan-requirement`, `/otp/send`, `/otp/verify`, `/me`, `/logout`, `/track`.
